554	     * today when omitted - but it may never be in the future. The check is applied to the raw
555	     * supplied value before the business-day adjustment ({@link #businessDay(LocalDate)}), so a
556	     * future date is rejected regardless of how that adjustment would move it. A future date is
557	     * reported through a {@link FutureRegistrationDateException}, which the
558	     * {@code ExceptionControllerAdvice} renders as a 400 Bad Request response naming the
559	     * {@code registrationDate} field.
