725	     * normalized (lower-cased) email or the empty string when absent (see
726	     * {@link EmailNormalizer#normalize(String)}), and the owner's {@code householdId} or the empty
727	     * string when absent, joined by {@code '|'}. Two owners are duplicates exactly when their whole
728	     * identity keys are equal. The key never contains {@code null} segments, so the create endpoint's
729	     * single duplicate check compares this one value across owners.
