745	     * ignored (a {@code null} key never equals the sought key). The create endpoint's duplicate
746	     * checks reduce both an existing owner and the owner being created to the same canonical key;
747	     * this returns the matched existing owner itself, so a caller can either reject the collision or
748	     * record which owner was matched.
