796	    /**
797	     * Reduces the household {@code lastName} to a canonical form for case-insensitive,
798	     * whitespace-insensitive comparison: leading and trailing whitespace is trimmed, every run of
799	     * internal whitespace is collapsed to a single space, and the result is lower-cased using
800	     * {@link java.util.Locale#ROOT} so comparison is locale-independent.
