812	     * hash of {@code normalizedLastName + '|' + postcode} (see {@link #canonicalizeHousehold(String)}
813	     * for the last-name normalization), so every owner with the same last name and postcode -
814	     * regardless of casing or spacing - is automatically assigned the identical value. Owners without
815	     * a postcode have no household basis and are given no household id ({@code null}).
816	     *
817	     * @param owner the owner being created
818	     * @return the shared household identifier, or {@code null} when the owner has no postcode
819	     */
